{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Dutch Parliamentary Proceedings 1930-2012, semanticized"},{"typeName":"alternativeTitle","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Handelingen der Staten Generaal 1930-2012, semanticized"]},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:51848"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Funding Agency: NWO 380-52-005; CLARIN WIP project"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M. Marx"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Informatics Institute, University of Amsterdam"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J. van Doornik"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Informatics Institute, University of Amsterdam"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"A. Nusselder"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Informatics Institute, University of Amsterdam"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"L. Buitinck"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Informatics Institute, University of Amsterdam"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J. van Doornik"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"University of Amsterdam"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>This dataset comprises all  the Parliamentary Proceedings of the Dutch Parliament and Senate from 1930 until april 2012 in an enriched XML format. Each document covers a distinct meeting, documents are grouped in folders by decade. This dataset contains the semanticized text in FoLiA annotation.<\/p><p>This dataset is part of the 2012 project PoliticalMashup.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2012-10-25"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Dutch Parliamentary Proceedings"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Dutch Parliament"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Dutch Senate"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Politics"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Handelingen der Staten-Generaal"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Parlement"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Politiek"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Eerste Kamer"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Kamer"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch","English"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2012-10-10"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2012-10-31"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2012-10-25"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>This page refers to a collection of datasets related to the Dutch Parliament and Senate of the period 1814-2012, they are all part of the 2012 project PoliticalMashup. These datasets are created by a group of researchers of the Informatics Institute, University of Amsterdam.<\/p><p>The collection includes:<\/p><p>A. Biographical data of all Members of Parliament of the Netherlands from 1814 - april 2012 (dataset \"PoliticalMashup 1814-2012\")<\/p><p>B. Data on all Political Parties of the Netherlands with at least one seat in Parliament or the Senate from 1814 - april 2012 (dataset \"PoliticalMashup 1814-2012\")<\/p><p>C. The proceedings of both Parliament and Senate.<\/p><p>The proceedings are available in three forms:<br>1) enriched and non-semanticized (dataset \"Dutch parliamentary proceedings 1814-2012 non-semanticized\")<br>2) enriched and semanticized in FoLiA annotation (dataset \"Dutch parliamentary proceedings 1930-2012, semanticized\")<br>3) as a list of named entities with references back to the text (dataset \"Dutch parliamentary proceedings 1930-2012, named entities\").<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Website Staten Generaal Digitaal \nWebsite Overheid.nl - Officiële Bekendma